  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Council for the Development of Social Science Research in Africa (CODESRIA) &#xe4;r en pasn-afrikansk samh&#xe4;llsvetenskaplig forskningsorganisation med m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning att st&#xf6;dja och fr&#xe4;mja forskning och kunskapsproduktion i Afrika. Dessutom st&#xf6;djer man publicering och spridning av forskningsresultat. Sida ger &quot;core support&quot;(bas st&#xf6;d)till organisationen. Avtalat belopp MSEK 72 450 000</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Council for the Development of Social Sxcience Research in Africa (CODESRIA) is a pan-African social science research organization. CODESRIA supports research and knowledge production in Africa. Besides, the organisation is involved in spreading research and publications on Africa. Sida gives core support to CODESRIA. Agreed amount MSEK 72 450 000.</narrative>
